     "sense": 1,
     "vi": "Zuo Zhuan; 2018, Vietnamese translation by Huỳnh Chương Hưng",
     "en": "I, the low-born one, still have an elderly mother; she has tasted every kind of foods at home, yet she has never tasted delicacies belonging to you, my ruler. Now I beg you, my ruler, to allow the low-born me to bring these pieces of meat home to my mother."
